 the police but this is one more case that shows how poorly trained and ignorant they are.  We need to give them less laws to in-force and far more training, say marine boot camp for starters, then maybe a tour with the army overseas and all along the way personality tests, repeat the process every couple years.  Add to it an oath that they are not out there to protect themselves, they are out there to protect the public.&lt;br /&gt;IF I had the names of that Swat team, I would call 911 every day to report drug dealings at their house, at their parent&amp;#39;s house, at their brother&amp;#39;s house, at their friends house.....</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6551162514259207104/comments/default/7553014126052879966'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6551162514259207104/comments/default/7553014126052879966'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/05/death-squad-damage-control-in-tucson.html?showComment=1306987290643#c7553014126052879966' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/05/death-squad-damage-control-in-tucson.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6551162514259207104' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6551162514259207104' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-342224358"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="June 1, 2011 at 10:01 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5227336620414211996</id><published>2011-06-01T01:48:41.175-06:00</published><updated>2011-06-01T01:48:41.175-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Incredible article and horrific incident. I have c...</title><content type='html'>Incredible article and horrific incident. I have copied your article in whole on my blog. I hope you don&amp;#39;t mind. If you do, please let me know. Thank you for exposing this horrendous actions. The police have forgotten they are public servants and now think they are public controllers! (it&amp;#39;s posted here by the way - http://endthelie.com/2011/06/01/death-squad-liquifies-veteran-with-60-bullets-then-defends-their-actions/ )</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6551162514259207104/comments/default/5227336620414211996'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6551162514259207104/comments/default/5227336620414211996'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/05/death-squad-damage-control-in-tucson.html?showComment=1306914521175#c5227336620414211996' title=''/><author><name>Independent News</name><uri>http://endthelie.com</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/05/death-squad-damage-control-in-tucson.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6551162514259207104' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6551162514259207104' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1786052869"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="June 1, 2011 at 1:48 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7149165120354091933</id><published>2011-05-28T16:49:21.606-06:00</published><updated>2011-05-28T16:49:21.606-06:00</updated><title type='text'>http://oathkeepers.org/oath/2011/05/25/oath-keeper